          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Pizza</h1>\n    <h3>Deep Dish Pizza</h3>\n    <p>This style of pizza is famously associated with the city of Chicago, Illinois. They call it deep dish because it's deep! Sometimes it seems more like a soup than pizza</p>\n    <h3>Matzah Pizza</h3>\n    <p>This pizza uses matzah, a kosher kind of flatbread used in Jewish cuisine. Because Jews are forbidden from eating leavened bread during Passover, some individuals use matzo as a substitute for traditional pizza crusts during the holiday.</p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
